@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260715-1tzaed — macOS signed distribution sequence

participant "Release orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Archive builder" as Builder
participant "Bundle/entitlement inspector" as Inspector
participant "Protected signer" as Signer
participant "DMG packager" as Packager
participant "Apple notary service" as Notary
participant "Private GitHub release" as GitHub
participant "Clean supported Mac" as Mac

Orchestrator -> Builder : immutable source + versions + accepted relay staging digest
Builder --> Orchestrator : unsigned archive + inventory + hashes
Orchestrator -> Inspector : verify host/extension topology and pre-sign inputs
Inspector --> Orchestrator : exact matrix pass
Orchestrator -> Signer : sign nested code inside-out\nminimum entitlements + hardened runtime
Signer -> Inspector : signed application
Inspector --> Orchestrator : strict signatures + actual entitlements pass
Orchestrator -> Packager : signed application digest
Packager --> Orchestrator : versioned and stable-name DMG bytes + checksums
Orchestrator -> Notary : submit exact candidate digest
Notary --> Orchestrator : accepted request + log
Orchestrator -> Packager : staple and verify ticket
Packager -> Mac : quarantined Gatekeeper/install smoke
Mac --> Orchestrator : install/upgrade/extension/rollback evidence
Orchestrator -> GitHub : publish immutable versioned asset\nthen verified stable authenticated asset
GitHub --> Orchestrator : remote sizes, hashes, release IDs
@enduml